SUMMARY:🔴 St Marcellus I\, Pope & Martyr
DESCRIPTION:III class · red · Time after Epiphany\nMass: Mass of the feas
 t (Proper of Saints\, 16 Jan\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria ye
 s · Credo no · Preface: Common\nFast: Abstinence from meat (no fast)\nPo
 pe from 308 to 309\, who reorganized the Roman Church after the Diocletian
  persecution. His strict penances for apostates provoked riots\, and Maxen
 tius banished him\; he died in exile that year.\nSt Marcellus I · patron 
 of stable-hands\, grooms\nNovena to Saint Marcellus I: https://www.catholi
 cdoors.com/prayers/novenas/p03946.htm\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): ht
 tps://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=01-16-2026&com
