 ast (Proper of Saints\, 17 Jan\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria 
 yes · Credo no · Preface: Common\nEgyptian ascetic (251–356) who withd
 rew to the desert about 285 and drew the first communities of monks around
  him. Athanasius's Life of Antony\, with its account of his temptations\, 
 spread monasticism across the Church.\nSt Anthony · patron of monks\, her
 mits\, domestic animals\, swineherds\, butchers\, basket-makers\, gravedig
 gers\, against skin diseases\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www
 .divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=01-17-2026&command=pray
 Missa&version=Rubrics%201960%20-%201960&lang2=English\nLauds: https://www.
