 ictim of the Decian persecution\, executed 20 January 250. Sebastian\, a s
 oldier of Diocletian's guard\, was shot with arrows about 288\, survived\,
  and was clubbed to death.\nSts Fabian · patron of St Sebastian: athletes
 \, soldiers\, archers\, plague\; St Fabian: potters\nLitany in Honour of S
 aint Sebastian: https://www.catholicdoors.com/prayers/english5/p03300.htm\
