 t (Proper of Saints\, 21 Jan\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria ye
 s · Credo no · Preface: Common\nRoman girl of twelve or thirteen execute
 d about 304 under Diocletian for refusing marriage and sacrifice\, buried 
 on the Via Nomentana. Ambrose\, Damasus\, and Prudentius wrote of her with
 in a century\; named in the Roman Canon.\nSt Agnes · patron of young girl
 s\, chastity\, virgins\, betrothed couples\, rape victims\, gardeners\nSt.
  Agnes Novena: https://www.praymorenovenas.com/st-agnes-novena\nMass prope
