DESCRIPTION:III class · red · Time after Epiphany\nMass: Mass of the feas
 t (Proper of Saints\, 22 Jan\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria ye
 s · Credo no · Preface: Common\nVincent\, deacon of Saragossa\, was tort
 ured to death at Valencia in 304 under the governor Dacian. Anastasius\, a
  Persian soldier turned monk\, was strangled near the Euphrates in 628 und
 er Chosroes II.\nSts Vincent & Anastasius · patron of St Vincent: vintner
 s\, vinegar-makers\, sailors\, Lisbon\, Valencia\nMass propers (Divinum Of
 ficium): https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=01-
