SUMMARY:⚪ St Raymond of Peñafort\, Confessor
DESCRIPTION:III class · white · Time after Epiphany\nMass: Mass of the fe
 ast (Proper of Saints\, 23 Jan\, or Common)\nCommemorations: St Emerentian
 a\, Virgin & Martyr\nGloria yes · Credo no · Preface: Common\nFast: Abst
 inence from meat (no fast)\nCatalan Dominican canonist (c. 1175–1275) wh
 o compiled the Decretals of Gregory IX in 1234\, the standard code of chur
 ch law for seven centuries. Third master general of the order\; died at Ba
 rcelona aged nearly 100.\nSt Raymond of Peñafort · patron of canon lawye
 rs\, canonists\, lawyers\, medical record librarians\nSt. Raymond Penyafor
 t Novena: https://www.praymorenovenas.com/st-raymond-penyafort-novena\nFos
 ter sister of Agnes\, still a catechumen\, stoned to death by a pagan crow
 d while praying at Agnes's tomb on the Via Nomentana about 304. Buried nea
 rby\; her name appears in the earliest Roman martyr lists.\nSt Emerentiana
  · patron of against colic and stomach ache\nMass propers (Divinum Offici
 um): https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=01-23-2
 026&command=prayMissa&version=Rubrics%201960%20-%201960&lang2=English\nLau
 ds: https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/horas/Pofficium.pl?date1=01-23
 -2026&command=prayLaudes&version=Rubrics%201960%20-%201960&lang2=English\n
 Vespers: https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/horas/Pofficium.pl?date1=
 01-23-2026&command=prayVesperae&version=Rubrics%201960%20-%201960&lang2=En
 glish\nCompline: https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/horas/Pofficium.p
