 s · Credo no · Preface: Common\nPaul's companion from Lystra\, recipient
  of two New Testament letters\, and first bishop of Ephesus. Tradition rec
 ords he was beaten to death about 97 after protesting a pagan festival in 
 the city.\nSt Timothy · patron of against stomach and intestinal ailments
 \nSt. Timothy Novena: https://www.praymorenovenas.com/st-timothy-novena\nM
 ass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/mi
