 t (Proper of Saints\, 26 Jan\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria ye
 s · Credo no · Preface: Common\nBishop of Smyrna and disciple of the apo
 stle John\, burned alive in the city's stadium about 155 at the age of 86.
  The Martyrdom of Polycarp is the earliest surviving account of a Christia
 n martyr's death.\nSt Polycarp · patron of against earache and dysentery\
 nSt. Polycarp Novena: https://www.praymorenovenas.com/st-polycarp-novena\n
