SUMMARY:⚪ St John Chrysostom\, Bishop\, Confessor & Doctor
DESCRIPTION:III class · white · Time after Epiphany\nMass: Mass of the fe
 ast (Proper of Saints\, 27 Jan\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria 
 yes · Credo yes · Preface: Common\nPriest of Antioch and patriarch of Co
 nstantinople from 398 (c. 349–407)\, called 'golden-mouthed' for his pre
 aching. His rebukes of court luxury led the Empress Eudoxia to exile him\;
  he died on the road in Pontus.\nSt John Chrysostom · patron of preachers
 \, orators\, lecturers\, epileptics\, Constantinople\nSt. John Chrysostom 
 Novena: https://www.praymorenovenas.com/st-john-chrysostom-novena\nMass pr
 opers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pm
