SUMMARY:⚪ St Francis de Sales\, Bishop\, Confessor & Doctor
DESCRIPTION:III class · white · Time after Epiphany\nMass: Mass of the fe
 ast (Proper of Saints\, 29 Jan\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria 
 yes · Credo yes · Preface: Common\nBishop of Geneva (1567–1622)\, resi
 dent at Annecy\, who reconverted the Chablais from Calvinism and wrote the
  Introduction to the Devout Life. Co-founded the Visitation nuns with Jane
  de Chantal in 1610\; Doctor 1877.\nSt Francis de Sales · patron of write
 rs\, journalists\, the Catholic press\, the deaf\, educators\, confessors\
 nLitany in Honour of St. Francis de Sales: https://www.catholicdoors.com/p
 rayers/litanies/p03563.htm\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.d
 ivinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=01-29-2026&command=prayMi
 ssa&version=Rubrics%201960%20-%201960&lang2=English\nLauds: https://www.di
