SUMMARY:🔴 St Martina\, Virgin & Martyr
DESCRIPTION:III class · red · Time after Epiphany\nMass: Mass of the feas
 t (Proper of Saints\, 30 Jan\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria ye
 s · Credo no · Preface: Common\nFast: Abstinence from meat (no fast)\nRo
 man virgin martyred traditionally under Alexander Severus about 228. Her r
 elics were found in 1634 beneath her church at the Forum\, and Urban VIII 
 rebuilt the church and composed hymns for her office.\nSt Martina · patro
 n of Rome\, nursing mothers\nNovena to Saint Martina of Rome: https://www.
 catholicdoors.com/prayers/novenas/p03932.htm\nMass propers (Divinum Offici
 um): https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=01-30-2
