DESCRIPTION:II class · white · Septuagesima\nMass: Mass of the feast (Pro
 per of Saints\, 2 Feb\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria yes · Cr
 edo yes · Preface: Blessed Virgin Mary\nCandlemas\, 2 February: Mary's pu
 rification and the presentation of Jesus in the Temple forty days after hi
 s birth\, when Simeon called him a light to the Gentiles. Kept at Jerusale
 m by the 380s\; the candle procession is 7th-century Roman.\nPresentation 
