DESCRIPTION:IV class · violet · Septuagesima\nMass: Mass of the preceding
  Sunday (or a votive / daily Mass for the dead)\nCommemorations: St Blaise
 \, Bishop & Martyr\nGloria no · Credo no · Preface: Common\nBishop of Se
 baste in Armenia\, torn with iron wool-combs and beheaded about 316 under 
 Licinius. The legend that he saved a boy choking on a fishbone gave rise t
 o the blessing of throats on his feast.\nSt Blaise · patron of throat ail
 ments\, wool-combers\, veterinarians\, wild animals\, Dubrovnik\nNovena in
  Honor of St. Blaise: https://www.ewtn.com/catholicism/devotions/novena-in
 -honor-of-st-blaise-288\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divi
