DESCRIPTION:III class · white · Septuagesima\nMass: Mass of the feast (Pr
 oper of Saints\, 4 Feb\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria yes · C
 redo no · Preface: Common\nFlorentine Carmelite (1302–1374)\, bishop of
  Fiesole from 1349\, known as a mediator between the warring factions of T
 uscan cities. Urban V sent him to pacify Bologna\; canonized 1629.\nSt And
 rew Corsini · patron of against riots and sudden death\, diplomats\, Flor
 ence\nNovena to Saint Andrew Corsini: https://www.catholicdoors.com/prayer
 s/novenas/p03970.htm\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinum
