 do no · Preface: Common\nVirgin of Catania in Sicily\, tortured and kille
 d about 251 under Decius after refusing the consul Quintianus\; her breast
 s were cut off. Named in the Roman Canon\; her veil is carried against eru
 ptions of Etna.\nSt Agatha · patron of breast cancer\, nurses\, bell-foun
 ders\, bakers\, against fire and earthquakes\, Catania\, Malta\nSt. Agatha
  Novena: https://www.praymorenovenas.com/st-agatha-novena\nMass propers (D
