 yVesperae&version=Rubrics%201960%20-%201960&lang2=English\nCompline: https
 ://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/horas/Pofficium.pl?date1=02-06-2026&com
 mand=prayCompletorium&version=Rubrics%201960%20-%201960&lang2=English
