 oper of Saints\, 7 Feb\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria yes · C
 redo no · Preface: Common\nNobleman of Ravenna (c. 951–1027) who became
  a monk after his father killed a man in a duel. Founded the hermitage of 
 Camaldoli about 1012\, origin of the Camaldolese\, joining hermit life to 
 the Benedictine Rule.\nSt Romuald · patron of Camaldolese\nPrayer for the
  Feast of Saint Romuald\, Abbot: https://www.catholic.org/prayers/prayer.p
 hp?p=190\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumofficium.com
 /cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=02-07-2026&command=prayMissa&version=Rubric
