SUMMARY:⚪ St Cyril of Alexandria\, Bishop\, Confessor & Doctor
DESCRIPTION:III class · white · Septuagesima\nMass: Mass of the feast (Pr
 oper of Saints\, 9 Feb\, or Common)\nCommemorations: St Apollonia\, Virgin
  & Martyr\nGloria yes · Credo yes · Preface: Common\nPatriarch of Alexan
 dria from 412 to 444\, who presided at the Council of Ephesus in 431 and s
 ecured the condemnation of Nestorius. His defense of Mary as Theotokos def
 ined the unity of Christ's person\; Doctor 1882.\nSt Cyril of Alexandria 
 · patron of Alexandria\nSt. Cyril of Alexandria Novena: https://www.praym
 orenovenas.com/st-cyril-of-alexandria-novena\nAged deaconess of Alexandria
  seized in an anti-Christian riot in 249\; the mob broke out her teeth and
  she walked into the fire they had prepared. Her bishop Dionysius recorded
  the death in a letter preserved by Eusebius.\nSt Apollonia · patron of d
 entists\, toothache\, dental diseases\nSt. Apollonia Novena: https://www.p
 raymorenovenas.com/st-apollonia-novena\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): h
 ttps://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=02-09-2026&co
 mmand=prayMissa&version=Rubrics%201960%20-%201960&lang2=English\nLauds: ht
