 oper of Saints\, 10 Feb\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria yes · 
 Credo no · Preface: Common\nTwin sister of Benedict (c. 480–543)\, who 
 led a community of nuns near Monte Cassino. Gregory's Dialogues tell how h
 er prayer brought a storm that kept Benedict talking with her the night be
 fore she died.\nSt Scholastica · patron of nuns\, Benedictine nuns\, conv
 ulsive children\, against storms and rain\nLitany in Honour of St. Scholas
 tica: https://www.catholicdoors.com/prayers/litanies/p03538.htm\nMass prop
 ers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmis
 sa.pl?date1=02-10-2026&command=prayMissa&version=Rubrics%201960%20-%201960
