DESCRIPTION:III class · white · Septuagesima\nMass: Mass of the feast (Pr
 oper of Saints\, 11 Feb\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria yes · 
 Credo yes · Preface: Blessed Virgin Mary\nCommemorates the eighteen appar
 itions to Bernadette Soubirous at the grotto of Massabielle between 11 Feb
 ruary and 16 July 1858\, where the Lady said 'I am the Immaculate Concepti
 on.' Pius X extended the feast to the whole Church in 1907.\nLitany of Our
  Lady of Lourdes: https://www.ewtn.com/catholicism/library/litany-of-our-l
 ady-of-lourdes-9127\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumo
