 in 1233 for Monte Senario and founded the Servants of Mary\, devoted to he
 r sorrows. Alexis Falconieri\, the last\, died in 1310\; all seven were ca
 nonized together in 1888.\nPrayer for the Seven Holy Founders of the Servi
 te Order: https://www.catholicdoors.com/prayers/english5/p03122.htm\nMass 
 propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/
