 nts\, 24 Feb\, or Common)\nCommemorations: Tuesday of Lent\nGloria yes · 
 Credo yes · Preface: Apostles\nFast: Fast only (meat permitted at the pri
 ncipal meal)\nChosen by lot to replace Judas among the Twelve before Pente
 cost (Acts 1)\, having followed Jesus from John's baptism. Later tradition
 s place his preaching in Judea or Ethiopia\; relics claimed at Trier since
  the 11th century.\nSt Matthias · patron of alcoholics\, carpenters\, tai
