 Saints\, 7 Mar\, or Common)\nAd libitum: Mass of the feria with commemorat
 ion of St Thomas Aquinas\, Confessor & Doctor\, or Mass of the feast with 
 commemoration of the feria.\nCommemorations: Saturday of Lent\nGloria yes 
 · Credo yes · Preface: Lent\nFast: Fast and complete abstinence\nDominic
 an of Roccasecca (1225–1274)\, master at Paris and Naples\, author of th
 e Summa Theologiae and the Corpus Christi office. Died at Fossanova on his
  way to the Council of Lyon\; Doctor 1567.\nSt Thomas Aquinas · patron of
  students\, universities\, schools\, theologians\, philosophers\, booksell
 ers\, pencil-makers\, chastity\nLitany in Honour of St. Thomas Aquinas: ht
 tps://www.catholicdoors.com/prayers/litanies/p03545.htm\nMass propers (Div
