DESCRIPTION:III class · white · Lent\nMass: Mass of the feast (Proper of 
 Saints\, 9 Mar\, or Common)\nAd libitum: Mass of the feria with commemorat
 ion of St Frances of Rome\, Widow\, or Mass of the feast with commemoratio
 n of the feria.\nCommemorations: Monday of Lent\nGloria yes · Credo no ·
  Preface: Lent\nFast: Fast only (meat permitted at the principal meal)\nRo
 man noblewoman (1384–1440)\, married forty years to Lorenzo Ponziani\, w
 ho nursed the poor through plague and civil war. Founded the Oblates of To
 r de' Specchi in 1425 and joined them after her husband died.\nSt Frances 
 of Rome · patron of motorists\, Benedictine oblates\, widows\, Rome\nSt. 
 Frances of Rome Novena: https://www.praymorenovenas.com/st-frances-of-rome
 -novena\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumofficium.com/
