 on of Forty Holy Martyrs\, or Mass of the feast with commemoration of the 
 feria.\nCommemorations: Tuesday of Lent\nGloria yes · Credo no · Preface
 : Lent\nFast: Fast only (meat permitted at the principal meal)\nForty sold
 iers of the Twelfth Legion left naked overnight on a frozen lake at Sebast
 e in Armenia in 320 under Licinius. One gave up\; a guard took his place. 
 Basil preached on them within fifty years.\nMass propers (Divinum Officium
 ): https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=03-10-202
