SUMMARY:⚪ St Patrick\, Bishop & Confessor
DESCRIPTION:III class · white · Lent\nMass: Mass of the feast (Proper of 
 Saints\, 17 Mar\, or Common)\nAd libitum: Mass of the feria with commemora
 tion of St Patrick\, Bishop & Confessor\, or Mass of the feast with commem
 oration of the feria.\nCommemorations: Tuesday of Lent\nGloria yes · Cred
 o no · Preface: Lent\nFast: Fast only (meat permitted at the principal me
 al)\nRoman Briton (c. 385–461) enslaved in Ireland at sixteen\, who esca
 ped and returned about 432 as bishop to convert the island. His Confessio 
 is the earliest Irish document\; died at Saul near Downpatrick.\nSt Patric
 k · patron of Ireland\, engineers\, against snakes\, Nigeria\, Boston\, N
 ew York\nSt. Patrick Novena: https://www.praymorenovenas.com/st-patrick-no
 vena-prayers-patron-saint-of-ireland\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): htt
