 he feast with commemoration of the feria.\nCommemorations: Wednesday of Le
 nt\nGloria yes · Credo yes · Preface: Lent\nFast: Fast only (meat permit
 ted at the principal meal)\nBishop of Jerusalem from 350 (c. 315–386)\, 
 exiled three times under Arian emperors. His Catechetical Lectures\, given
  at the Holy Sepulchre\, are the chief 4th-century witness to baptismal an
 d eucharistic rites\; Doctor 1882.\nCyril of Jerusalem Novena: https://www
