 oration of the feria.\nCommemorations: Tuesday of Passion Week\nGloria yes
  · Credo no · Preface: Holy Cross\nFast: Fast only (meat permitted at th
 e principal meal)\nThe archangel who interpreted Daniel's visions and anno
