DESCRIPTION:III class · white · Passiontide\nMass: Mass of the feast (Pro
 per of Saints\, 27 Mar\, or Common)\nAd libitum: Mass of the feria with co
 mmemoration of St John Damascene\, Confessor & Doctor\, or Mass of the fea
