SUMMARY:🔴 St Hermenegild\, Martyr
DESCRIPTION:III class · red · Paschaltide\nMass: Mass of the feast (Prope
 r of Saints\, 13 Apr\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria yes · Cre
 do no · Preface: Easter\nVisigothic prince\, son of the Arian king Leovig
 ild\, converted to Catholicism by Bishop Leander of Seville about 579. Aft
 er a failed revolt he was executed at Tarragona on 13 April 585 for refusi
 ng communion from an Arian bishop.\nSt Hermenegild · patron of converts\,
  Seville\nCollect for the Feast of Saint Hermenegild: https://www.catholic
 .org/prayers/prayer.php?p=3253\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://w
 ww.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=04-13-2026&command=pr
 ayMissa&version=Rubrics%201960%20-%201960&lang2=English\nLauds: https://ww
