 Wednesday (Minor Litanies): Procession with the Litany of the Saints and M
 ass of Rogations (violet) where held\; otherwise commemoration.\nJesuit fr
 om Montepulciano (1542–1621) whose Controversies were the chief Catholic
  answer to Protestant theology. Cardinal from 1599\, archbishop of Capua\,
