SUMMARY:⚪ St John Baptist de la Salle\, Confessor
DESCRIPTION:III class · white · Paschaltide\nMass: Mass of the feast (Pro
 per of Saints\, 15 May\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria yes · C
 redo no · Preface: Easter\nFast: Abstinence from meat (no fast)\nCanon of
  Reims (1651–1719) who gave up his fortune to found the Brothers of the 
 Christian Schools in 1680. Introduced free schools\, classroom teaching in
  the vernacular\, and the first training colleges for lay teachers.\nSt Jo
 hn Baptist de la Salle · patron of teachers\, educators\, school principa
 ls\, students\nNovena to Saint Jean-Baptiste de La Salle: https://www.cath
