SUMMARY:🔴 St Venantius\, Martyr
DESCRIPTION:III class · red · Paschaltide\nMass: Mass of the feast (Prope
 r of Saints\, 18 May\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria yes · Cre
 do no · Preface: Easter\nBoy of fifteen martyred at Camerino in the March
 es\, traditionally under Decius about 250. His Acts are late and legendary
 \; Clement X\, a native of Camerino\, raised the feast for the whole Churc
 h in 1670.\nSt Venantius · patron of Camerino\, against falls\nNovena to 
 Saint Venantius: https://www.catholicdoors.com/prayers/novenas/p03938.htm\
