 ed 1450.\nSt Bernardine of Siena · patron of advertising\, public relatio
 ns\, communications\, gambling addicts\, chest ailments\, hoarseness\nSt. 
 Bernardine of Siena Novena: https://www.praymorenovenas.com/st-bernardine-
 of-siena-novena\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumoffic
