SUMMARY:⚪ Visitation of the Blessed Virgin Mary (II)
DESCRIPTION:II class · white · Time after Pentecost\nMass: Mass of the fe
 ast (Proper of Saints\, 2 Jul\, or Common)\nCommemorations: Sts Processus 
 & Martinian\, Martyrs\nGloria yes · Credo yes · Preface: Blessed Virgin 
 Mary\nCommemorates Mary's journey to Elizabeth and the Magnificat (Luke 1:
 39-56). Kept by the Franciscans from 1263\, it was extended to the whole C
 hurch by Urban VI in 1389 to pray for the end of the Western Schism.\nVisi
 tation Novena: https://www.praymorenovenas.com/visitation-novena\nRoman ma
 rtyrs buried on the Via Aurelia\; later legend made them the Mamertine jai
 lers converted by Peter and Paul. Their relics have rested in St Peter's s
 ince Paschal I moved them there in the 9th century.\nSts Processus & Marti
 nian · patron of jailers\, prison guards\nCollect for the Feast of Saints
  Processus and Martinian: https://www.catholic.org/prayers/prayer.php?p=32
 63\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-b
 in/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=07-02-2026&command=prayMissa&version=Rubrics%2019
