 , Virgin & Martyr\nGloria yes · Credo no · Preface: Common\nVenetian sol
 dier (1486-1537) who vowed himself to God while a prisoner in 1511 and dev
 oted himself to orphans. He founded the Somaschi Fathers in 1532 and died 
 of plague caught while nursing the sick.\nSt Jerome Emiliani · patron of 
 orphans\, abandoned children\nSt. Jerome Emiliani Novena: https://www.pray
 morenovenas.com/st-jerome-emiliani-novena\nVirgin martyr of Antioch in Pis
 idia\, killed about 304 under Diocletian. Her legend\, in which she bursts
