 ers\; Joan of Arc named her among her voices.\nSt Margaret · patron of ch
 ildbirth\, pregnant women\, nurses\, kidney disease\, the dying\nPrayer fo
 r the Feast of St. Margaret of Antioch: https://www.catholicculture.org/cu
