 st (Proper of Saints\, 23 Jul\, or Common)\nCommemorations: St Liborius\, 
 Bishop & Confessor\nGloria yes · Credo no · Preface: Common\nFirst bisho
 p of Ravenna\, by tradition sent from Antioch by St Peter\, martyred at th
 e port of Classe in the 1st or 2nd century. The basilica of Sant'Apollinar
 e in Classe was consecrated over his tomb in 549.\nSt Apollinaris · patro
 n of Ravenna\, against epilepsy and gout\nBishop of Le Mans in Gaul for ne
 arly fifty years\, dying about 397. The translation of his relics to Pader
 born in 836 created a bond between the two cities that has lasted into mod
 ern times.\nSt Liborius · patron of against gallstones\, colic and fevers
 \; Paderborn\nPrayer for the Feast of St. Liborius: https://www.catholiccu
