 o Emperor Galerius at Nicomedia\, martyred under Diocletian about 305 afte
 r treating the poor without charge. One of the Fourteen Holy Helpers\; a r
 elic of his blood is kept at Ravello.\nSt Pantaleon · patron of physician
 s\, midwives\, livestock\, against headaches\; Fourteen Holy Helpers\nPray
 er for the Feast of St. Pantaleon: https://catholicculture.org/culture/lit
 urgicalyear/prayers/view.cfm?id=1458\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): htt
