 hose convalescent reading turned him to God. He wrote the Spiritual Exerci
 ses and founded the Society of Jesus\, approved in 1540.\nSt Ignatius of L
 oyola · patron of Jesuits\, soldiers\, retreats\, spiritual exercises\, B
 asque Country\nSt. Ignatius of Loyola Novena: https://www.praymorenovenas.
 com/st-ignatius-of-loyola-novena\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https:/
