 east (Proper of Saints\, 7 Aug\, or Common)\nCommemorations: St Donatus\, 
 Bishop & Martyr\nGloria yes · Credo no · Preface: Common\nFast: Abstinen
 ce from meat (no fast)\nPriest from Vicenza (1480-1547) who co-founded the
  Theatines in Rome in 1524 with Gian Pietro Carafa\, the first order of cl
 erks regular\, to reform clerical life. He died at Naples.\nSt Cajetan · 
 patron of the unemployed\, job seekers\, gamblers\, bankers\, workers\, Ar
 gentina\nSt. Cajetan of Thiene Novena: https://www.praymorenovenas.com/st-
 cajetan-of-thiene-novena\nBishop of Arezzo in Tuscany in the 4th century\,
  martyred by tradition under Julian the Apostate in 362. His acts tell of 
 a shattered chalice made whole at Mass\; his relics lie in the Arezzo cath
 edral.\nSt Donatus · patron of Arezzo\, against epilepsy and lightning\nM
 ass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/mi
