 ia and Armenia\, where he was flayed alive\; relics claimed at Benevento a
 nd on the Tiber Island in Rome.\nSt Bartholomew · patron of tanners\, lea
 therworkers\, bookbinders\, butchers\, plasterers\, Armenia\nSt. Bartholom
 ew Novena: https://www.praymorenovenas.com/st-bartholomew-novena\nMass pro
