 r before his death.\nSt Joseph Calasanctius · patron of Catholic schools\
 , students\, schoolchildren\, Piarists\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): h
 ttps://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=08-27-2026&co
