SUMMARY:⚪ Nativity of the Blessed Virgin Mary (II)
DESCRIPTION:II class · white · Time after Pentecost\nMass: Mass of the fe
 ast (Proper of Saints\, 8 Sep\, or Common)\nCommemorations: St Adrian\, Ma
 rtyr\nGloria yes · Credo yes · Preface: Blessed Virgin Mary\nCelebrates 
 the birth of Mary nine months after the Immaculate Conception. The date de
 rives from the dedication of the church of St Anne in Jerusalem\; Pope Ser
 gius I added it to the Roman calendar in the late 7th century.\nNativity o
 f the Blessed Virgin Mary Novena: https://www.praymorenovenas.com/nativity
 -of-the-blessed-virgin-mary-novena\nOfficer at Nicomedia converted by the 
 courage of Christians he was persecuting\, martyred about 306 under Galeri
 us\; his wife Natalia tended him in prison. His relics went to Constantino
 ple and later Rome.\nSt Adrian · patron of soldiers\, arms dealers\, butc
 hers\, prison guards\, against plague and epilepsy\nMass propers (Divinum 
 Officium): https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=0
