DESCRIPTION:II class · red · Time after Pentecost\nMass: Mass of the feas
 t (Proper of Saints\, 21 Sep\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria ye
 s · Credo yes · Preface: Apostles\nTax collector of Capernaum called by 
 Christ from his customs booth\; traditionally author of the first Gospel\,
  written for Jewish Christians. Later tradition sends him to Ethiopia or P
 ersia\; relics claimed at Salerno since the 10th century.\nSt Matthew · p
 atron of accountants\, bankers\, tax collectors\, bookkeepers\, customs of
