 ast (Proper of Saints\, 7 Oct\, or Common)\nCommemorations: St Mark\, Pope
  & Confessor\nGloria yes · Credo yes · Preface: Blessed Virgin Mary\nIns
 tituted by Pius V as Our Lady of Victory after the Christian fleet defeate
 d the Turks at Lepanto on October 7\, 1571\, a victory credited to the ros
 ary. Clement XI extended it to the whole Church in 1716.\nNovena to Our La
