 \nPope for eight months in 336\, successor of Sylvester I\; founded the ch
 urch of San Marco in Rome and a cemetery basilica on the Via Ardeatina\, w
 here he was buried.\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumo
 fficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=10-07-2026&command=prayMissa&ver
