 ishop\, Rusticus & Eleutherius\, Martyrs\nGloria yes · Credo no · Prefac
 e: Common\nFast: Abstinence from meat (no fast)\nPharmacist's apprentice t
 urned priest of Lucca (1541-1609)\; founded the Clerks Regular of the Moth
 er of God in 1574 and helped start the college that became Propaganda Fide
