SUMMARY:⚪ St Peter of Alcántara\, Confessor
DESCRIPTION:III class · white · Time after Pentecost\nMass: Mass of the f
 east (Proper of Saints\, 19 Oct\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria
  yes · Credo no · Preface: Common\nSpanish Franciscan (1499-1562) who fo
 unded the austere Discalced reform in Extremadura\; known for extreme pena
 nces\, sleeping an hour and a half a night for decades\, and as counselor 
 to Teresa of Ávila. Canonized 1669.\nSt Peter of Alcántara · patron of 
 Brazil\, Extremadura\, night watchmen\, eucharistic adoration\nNovena to S
 aint Peter of Alcantara: https://www.catholicdoors.com/prayers/novenas/p03
 887.htm\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumofficium.com/
 cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=10-19-2026&command=prayMissa&version=Rubrics
 %201960%20-%201960&lang2=English\nLauds: https://www.divinumofficium.com/c
