DESCRIPTION:III class · white · Time after Pentecost\nMass: Mass of the f
 east (Proper of Saints\, 20 Oct\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria
  yes · Credo no · Preface: Common\nPriest and professor of theology at t
 he University of Kraków (1390-1473)\, born at Kęty in Silesia\; known fo
 r learning\, several pilgrimages to Rome on foot\, and giving his goods to
  poor students. Canonized 1767.\nSt John Cantius · patron of Poland\, Lit
 huania\, professors\, students\, pilgrims\nSt. John Cantius Novena: https:
 //www.praymorenovenas.com/st-john-cantius-novena\nMass propers (Divinum Of
 ficium): https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=10-
