 0%20-%201960&lang2=English\nVespers: https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-b
 in/horas/Pofficium.pl?date1=11-09-2026&command=prayVesperae&version=Rubric
 s%201960%20-%201960&lang2=English\nCompline: https://www.divinumofficium.c
 om/cgi-bin/horas/Pofficium.pl?date1=11-09-2026&command=prayCompletorium&ve
 rsion=Rubrics%201960%20-%201960&lang2=English
