 command=prayLaudes&version=Rubrics%201960%20-%201960&lang2=English\nVesper
 s: https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/horas/Pofficium.pl?date1=11-10-
 2026&command=prayVesperae&version=Rubrics%201960%20-%201960&lang2=English\
 nCompline: https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/horas/Pofficium.pl?date
 1=11-10-2026&command=prayCompletorium&version=Rubrics%201960%20-%201960&la
