SUMMARY:🔴 St Martin I\, Pope & Martyr
DESCRIPTION:III class · red · Time after Pentecost\nMass: Mass of the fea
 st (Proper of Saints\, 12 Nov\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria y
 es · Credo no · Preface: Common\nPope 649 to 655\, who condemned Monothe
 litism at the Lateran Synod of 649 against the imperial edict\; arrested b
 y Constans II\, tried at Constantinople and exiled to the Crimea\, where h
 e died. The last pope honored as a martyr.\nPrayer for the Feast of Saint 
 Martin\, Pope: https://www.catholicdoors.com/prayers/english4/p02836.htm\n
 Mass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/m
