SUMMARY:⚪ St Frances Xavier Cabrini\, Virgin
DESCRIPTION:III class · white · Time after Pentecost\nMass: Mass of the f
 east (Proper of Saints\, 13 Nov\, or Common)\nCommemorations: St Didacus\,
  Confessor\nGloria yes · Credo no · Preface: Common\nFast: Abstinence fr
 om meat (no fast)\nFounded the Missionary Sisters of the Sacred Heart in L
 ombardy in 1880 (1850-1917)\; sent by Leo XIII to Italian immigrants in Ne
 w York in 1889\, she opened 67 schools\, hospitals and orphanages. First U
 nited States citizen canonized (1946).\nSt Frances Xavier Cabrini · patro
 n of immigrants\, emigrants\, hospital administrators\, orphans\nSt. Franc
 es Xavier Cabrini Novena: https://www.praymorenovenas.com/st-frances-xavie
 r-cabrini-novena\nSpanish Franciscan lay brother from Andalusia (about 140
 0-1463)\; served in the Canary Islands and nursed the sick at Rome's Araco
 eli during the 1450 jubilee\; died at Alcalá. Canonized 1588 after a cure
  attributed to him of Philip II's son.\nSt Didacus · patron of Franciscan
  lay brothers\, San Diego\, against sore throat\nPrayer for the Feast of S
 aint Didacus: https://www.catholicdoors.com/prayers/english4/p02835.htm\nM
 ass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/mi
 ssa/Pmissa.pl?date1=11-13-2026&command=prayMissa&version=Rubrics%201960%20
 -%201960&lang2=English\nLauds: https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/hor
 as/Pofficium.pl?date1=11-13-2026&command=prayLaudes&version=Rubrics%201960
 %20-%201960&lang2=English\nVespers: https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bi
 n/horas/Pofficium.pl?date1=11-13-2026&command=prayVesperae&version=Rubrics
 %201960%20-%201960&lang2=English\nCompline: https://www.divinumofficium.co
 m/cgi-bin/horas/Pofficium.pl?date1=11-13-2026&command=prayCompletorium&ver
 sion=Rubrics%201960%20-%201960&lang2=English
