SUMMARY:🔴 St Josaphat\, Bishop & Martyr
DESCRIPTION:III class · red · Time after Pentecost\nMass: Mass of the fea
 st (Proper of Saints\, 14 Nov\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria y
 es · Credo no · Preface: Common\nBasilian monk and Byzantine-rite archbi
 shop of Polotsk (about 1580-1623) who worked for union of the Ruthenian Ch
 urch with Rome\; killed by a mob at Vitebsk. The first Eastern saint forma
 lly canonized by Rome (1867).\nSt Josaphat · patron of Ukraine\, Christia
 n unity\, Eastern Catholics\nSt. Josaphat Novena: https://www.praymorenove
 nas.com/st-josaphat-novena\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.d
 ivinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=11-14-2026&command=prayMi
 ssa&version=Rubrics%201960%20-%201960&lang2=English\nLauds: https://www.di
 vinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/horas/Pofficium.pl?date1=11-14-2026&command=pray
 Laudes&version=Rubrics%201960%20-%201960&lang2=English\nVespers: https://w
