SUMMARY:⚪ St Gertrude\, Virgin
DESCRIPTION:III class · white · Time after Pentecost\nMass: Mass of the f
 east (Proper of Saints\, 16 Nov\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria
  yes · Credo no · Preface: Common\nNun of Helfta in Saxony (1256-about 1
 302) from the age of five\; her Herald of Divine Love records visions cent
 ered on the heart of Christ\, an early form of Sacred Heart devotion. Know
 n as Gertrude the Great.\nSt Gertrude · patron of the West Indies\, souls
  in Purgatory\, travellers\, against mice and rats\nLitany in Honour of Sa
 int Gertrude the Great: https://www.catholicdoors.com/prayers/litanies/p03
 551.htm\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumofficium.com/
