SUMMARY:⚪ St Gregory Thaumaturgus\, Bishop & Confessor
DESCRIPTION:III class · white · Time after Pentecost\nMass: Mass of the f
 east (Proper of Saints\, 17 Nov\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria
  yes · Credo no · Preface: Common\nPupil of Origen at Caesarea\, bishop 
 of Neocaesarea in Pontus from about 240 to 270\; said to have found 17 Chr
 istians there and left 17 pagans. Called the Wonderworker for miracles inc
 luding moving a mountain.\nSt Gregory Thaumaturgus · patron of against ea
 rthquakes\, floods\, desperate and forgotten causes\nPrayer to Saint Grego
 ry the Wonder Worker: https://www.catholicculture.org/culture/liturgicalye
 ar/prayers/view.cfm?id=1436\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.
 divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=11-17-2026&command=prayM
