  yes · Credo no · Preface: Common\nCommemorates the dedication of the Co
 nstantinian basilicas over the tombs of Peter on the Vatican hill and Paul
  on the Ostian Way\, and the consecration of the new St Peter's by Urban V
 III on November 18\, 1626.\nNovena to Saints Peter and Paul: https://www.p
 raymorenovenas.com/novena-to-saints-peter-and-paul\nMass propers (Divinum 
