SUMMARY:⚪ St Felix of Valois\, Confessor
DESCRIPTION:III class · white · Time after Pentecost\nMass: Mass of the f
 east (Proper of Saints\, 20 Nov\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria
  yes · Credo no · Preface: Common\nFast: Abstinence from meat (no fast)\
 nHermit of the Valois region (1127-1212) who with St John of Matha founded
  the Trinitarian Order at Cerfroid in 1198 to ransom Christian captives. H
 is life is known mostly from later Trinitarian tradition.\nSt Felix of Val
 ois · patron of Trinitarians\, captives\nPrayer for the Feast of Saint Fe
 lix of Valois: https://www.catholicdoors.com/prayers/english4/p02830.htm\n
 Mass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/m
