 ng brought as a child to the Temple in Jerusalem\, a story from the 2nd-ce
 ntury Protoevangelium of James. Kept in the East from the 6th century\; ex
 tended to the whole Church by Sixtus V in 1585.\nLitany of the Life of Mar
 y: https://www.catholicdoors.com/prayers/litanies/p03509.htm\nMass propers
