SUMMARY:⚪ St Sylvester\, Abbot
DESCRIPTION:III class · white · Time after Pentecost\nMass: Mass of the f
 east (Proper of Saints\, 26 Nov\, or Common)\nCommemorations: St Peter of 
 Alexandria\, Bishop & Martyr\nGloria yes · Credo no · Preface: Common\nS
 ylvester Gozzolini (1177-1267)\, a canon of Osimo who became a hermit afte
 r seeing the decayed corpse of a once-handsome relative\; founded the Sylv
 estrine Benedictines at Montefano near Fabriano in 1231.\nSt Sylvester · 
 patron of Sylvestrine Benedictines\nBishop of Alexandria from 300 and head
  of its catechetical school\; set rules for readmitting the lapsed and opp
 osed Arius's early teaching. Beheaded in 311 under Maximinus Daia\, the la
 st martyr of the persecution there.\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): http
 s://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=11-26-2026&comma
 nd=prayMissa&version=Rubrics%201960%20-%201960&lang2=English\nLauds: https
