SUMMARY:🔴 St Andrew\, Apostle (II)
DESCRIPTION:II class · red · Advent\nMass: Mass of the feast (Proper of S
 aints\, 30 Nov\, or Common)\nCommemorations: Monday of Advent\nGloria yes 
 · Credo yes · Preface: Apostles\nFisherman of Bethsaida\, brother of Sim
 on Peter and the first disciple called in John's Gospel\; preached in Gree
 ce and was crucified at Patras\, traditionally on an X-shaped cross. Relic
 s were taken to Constantinople in 357.\nSt Andrew · patron of Scotland\, 
 Russia\, Greece\, fishermen\, fishmongers\, singers\, rope-makers\, agains
 t sore throats\nSt. Andrew Novena: https://www.praymorenovenas.com/st-andr
 ew-novena\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumofficium.co
