SUMMARY:🔴 St Bibiana\, Virgin & Martyr
DESCRIPTION:III class · red · Advent\nMass: Mass of the feast (Proper of 
 Saints\, 2 Dec\, or Common)\nAd libitum: Mass of the feria with commemorat
 ion of St Bibiana\, Virgin & Martyr\, or Mass of the feast with commemorat
 ion of the feria.\nCommemorations: Wednesday of Advent\nGloria yes · Cred
 o no · Preface: Common\nRoman virgin said to have been scourged to death 
 about 363 under Julian the Apostate\; the church of Santa Bibiana on the E
 squiline was built over her tomb in the 5th century and rebuilt by Bernini
  in 1624.\nSt Bibiana · patron of against hangovers\, headaches\, epileps
 y\, mental illness\, single laywomen\nNovena to Saint Bibiana: https://www
 .catholicdoors.com/prayers/novenas/p04070.htm\nMass propers (Divinum Offic
