SUMMARY:⚪ St Francis Xavier\, Confessor
DESCRIPTION:III class · white · Advent\nMass: Mass of the feast (Proper o
 f Saints\, 3 Dec\, or Common)\nAd libitum: Mass of the feria with commemor
 ation of St Francis Xavier\, Confessor\, or Mass of the feast with commemo
 ration of the feria.\nCommemorations: Thursday of Advent\nGloria yes · Cr
 edo no · Preface: Common\nNavarrese nobleman (1506-1552) and one of the f
 irst Jesuits\; from 1542 a missionary in India\, the Moluccas and Japan\, 
 baptizing tens of thousands. Died on Shangchuan Island awaiting entry into
  China. Canonized 1622.\nSt Francis Xavier · patron of foreign missions\,
  missionaries\, navigators\, India\, Japan\, Australia\, Borneo\, Goa\nLit
 any in Honour of Saint Francis Xavier: https://www.catholicdoors.com/praye
 rs/litanies/p03558.htm\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divin
 umofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=12-03-2026&command=prayMissa&
 version=Rubrics%201960%20-%201960&lang2=English\nLauds: https://www.divinu
