 Saints\, 8 Dec\, or Common)\nCommemorations: Tuesday of Advent\nGloria yes
  · Credo yes · Preface: Blessed Virgin Mary\nHoly day of obligation (US)
 \nCelebrates Mary's preservation from original sin from the first moment o
 f her conception\, defined as dogma by Pius IX in 1854. Clement XI made th
 e feast universal in 1708\; the US bishops placed the country under this t
 itle in 1846.\nImmaculate Conception of the Blessed Virgin Mary (Patroness
  of the USA) · patron of United States of America\, Portugal\, Spain\, Br
 azil\, Philippines\, Korea\nLitany of the Immaculate Conception: https://w
 ww.catholicdoors.com/prayers/litanies/p03619.htm\nMass propers (Divinum Of
 ficium): https://www.divinumofficium.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=12-
