 ration of St Damasus I\, Pope & Confessor\, or Mass of the feast with comm
 emoration of the feria.\nCommemorations: Friday of Advent\nGloria yes · C
 redo no · Preface: Common\nFast: Abstinence from meat (no fast)\nPope fro
 m 366 to 384 after a violently contested election\; commissioned Jerome's 
 revision of the Latin Bible\, adorned the martyrs' tombs in the catacombs 
 with verse inscriptions\, and pressed the claims of the Roman see.\nSt Dam
 asus I · patron of archaeologists\nNovena to Saint Pope Damasus I: https:
 //www.catholicdoors.com/prayers/novenas/p03937.htm\nMass propers (Divinum 
