 f Saints\, 12 Dec\, or Common)\nAd libitum: Mass of the feria with commemo
 ration of Our Lady of Guadalupe\, or Mass of the feast with commemoration 
 of the feria.\nCommemorations: Saturday of Advent\nGloria yes · Credo yes
  · Preface: Blessed Virgin Mary\nCommemorates the apparitions of Mary to 
 the Indian Juan Diego on Tepeyac hill near Mexico City in December 1531 an
 d the image left on his tilma\, kept in the basilica there. Feast approved
