SUMMARY:🔴 St Stephen\, Protomartyr (II)
DESCRIPTION:II class · red · Christmastide\nMass: Mass of the feast (Prop
 er of Saints\, 26 Dec\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria yes · Cr
 edo no · Preface: Nativity\nOne of the seven deacons of Jerusalem\; stone
 d outside the city about 34 to 36 after his speech before the Sanhedrin (A
 cts 6-7)\, with Saul of Tarsus looking on. His relics were reported found 
 at Caphargamala in 415.\nSt Stephen · patron of deacons\, stonemasons\, b
 ricklayers\, horses\, against headaches\nLitany of Saint Stephen\, Protoma
 rtyr: https://catholicculture.org/culture/liturgicalyear/prayers/view.cfm?
 id=1096\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumofficium.com/
