SUMMARY:⚪ Sunday within the Octave of the Nativity
DESCRIPTION:II class · white · Christmastide\nMass: Proper Mass of the Su
 nday\nCommemorations: St John\, Apostle & Evangelist\nGloria yes · Credo 
 yes · Preface: Nativity\nMarks: Octave of Christmas\nSon of Zebedee\, the
  beloved disciple\, by tradition author of the fourth Gospel\, three epist
 les and Revelation\; cared for Mary after the Crucifixion\, was exiled to 
 Patmos\, and died at Ephesus about 100\, the only apostle not martyred.\nS
 t John · patron of theologians\, writers\, authors\, editors\, publishers
 \, booksellers\, friendship\, against poison and burns\nNovena to Saint Jo
 hn the Apostle and Evangelist: https://www.catholicdoors.com/prayers/noven
 as/p03882.htm\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumofficiu
 m.com/cgi-bin/missa/Pmissa.pl?date1=12-27-2026&command=prayMissa&version=R
