DESCRIPTION:II class · red · Christmastide\nMass: Mass of the feast (Prop
 er of Saints\, 28 Dec\, or Common)\nCommemorations: none\nGloria yes · Cr
 edo no · Preface: Nativity\nThe male children of Bethlehem aged two and u
 nder killed by Herod the Great in his attempt to destroy the infant Christ
  (Matthew 2:16). Honored since the 5th century as martyrs in deed though n
 ot in will.\nHoly Innocents · patron of babies\, children\, choirboys\, f
 oundlings\nHoly Innocents Novena: https://www.praymorenovenas.com/holy-inn
 ocents-novena\nMass propers (Divinum Officium): https://www.divinumofficiu
